<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Rpi-Cam on Mi&amp;Bee Blog</title><link>https://blog.mickeyzzc.tech/tags/rpi-cam/</link><description>Recent content in Rpi-Cam on Mi&amp;Bee Blog</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>zh-CN</language><managingEditor>蓝宝石的傻话</managingEditor><lastBuildDate>Sat, 30 May 2026 00:00:00 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://blog.mickeyzzc.tech/tags/rpi-cam/rss.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>MiBeeNvr v0.5.0: ONVIF 全协议与硬件转码</title><link>https://blog.mickeyzzc.tech/posts/mibee-oss/mibee-nvr-v0.5/</link><pubDate>Sat, 30 May 2026 00:00:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://blog.mickeyzzc.tech/posts/mibee-oss/mibee-nvr-v0.5/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;ONVIF 摄像头此前在 NVR 里能被发现、能拿到流地址——但这只是 ONVIF 的一角：云台控制、画面调参、事件订阅这些真正好用的部分都没有。另外不少摄像头只输出 H.265，浏览器直接播放不了。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>